e as we take you to hauntingly realistic locales like Desert Safari, City Square Bridge, Tomb of the Kings, Doctor Dragan\u2019s Labs, Mother Ship, Streets of Moscow, Amazonian Trenches and many more. Reign supreme in huge battlefields that can barely contain these towering brawl machines.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651560/extras/1e245c1057eb839b4528d585369b5157.avif?t=1510292210\" /></div><br><br>Show off your nerves of steel to take up battles with highly skilled robots in this perfect balance of realism and futurism. <br><br><strong>With all these forces at your helm, what are you waiting for?</strong>",
